---
import Layout from '../../Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Butterlu" description="Butterlu makes personalized picture frames for family milestones, made to order with the names, dates and words that matter to you.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About Butterlu</h1>
    <p class="lede">Butterlu makes personalized picture frames for the moments families want to keep: a new grandbaby on the way, a godparent ask, a wedding thank-you, a pet who is missed.</p>
    <p>Every frame is made to order for one person and one moment. Add their name, keep our wording or write your own, pick the colors, and we print it just as your preview shows.</p>
    <p>Thousands of shoppers found Butterlu on Etsy first. This shop is our own home for the same frames.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
